# M12 "Yetenek Yolları", flow "skills_warrior" run 2 (PostgreSQL test database only): the warrior of
# run 1 is level 10 (vo_admin set-level): 9 unspent skill points, the gold marker on "Yetenekler (K)",
# every tier 2 / 3 row locked. In the window it raises Ağır Darbe (the first "+" asks "geri
# alınamaz" once), which opens Hücum's tier 2 (2 points), then Yarma to tier 3, Kan Öfkesi, Kalkan
# Duvarı (Siper's tier 2 opens), Meydan Okuma and Sarsıntı: all 9 spent. Drags four skills onto the bar.
# Kan Öfkesi: the effect icon with its tooltip under the player's panel and the red aura. Kalkan Duvarı:
# the gold bubble flash. Then it pulls two Kül Çömezi (`pullpack`), taunts them with Meydan Okuma (the
# taunt shows on the target frame), stuns one with Sarsıntı (stars over its head) and hits both with
# one Yarma (the ring art).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m12_war
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+skillsknown+monsters 1800
expect world+level10+skillpoints9+skillmarker+canraise
expect world+locked0_2+locked0_3+locked1_2+locked1_3
scene expectskillpoints 9
scene expectslot 1 agir_darbe
wait 200
hoveron world.skills
wait 3
expecttext skills.tooltip Yetenekler (K)
expecttext skills.tooltip Yetenek puanı: 9
screenshot 01_points_marker.png
# ---- Spending: the first "+" asks once ----
key k
waitfor world+skillsopen 60
expecttext skills.points Yetenek puanı: 9
clickon skills.plus.agir_darbe
waitfor world+modal 60
expecttext messagebox.text geri alınamaz
screenshot 02_confirm.png
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+learned1+learnidle 300
scene expectrank agir_darbe 2
scene expectskillmessage Ağır Darbe kademe 2 oldu.
expecttext skills.message Ağır Darbe kademe 2 oldu.
expect world+skillpoints8+locked0_2
# The second point in Hücum opens tier 2 (no question any more).
clickon skills.plus.agir_darbe
waitfor world+learned2+learnidle 300
expect world+skillpoints7+unlocked0_2+locked0_3+locked1_2
expecttext skills.rank.agir_darbe 3/3
hoveron skills.cell.yarma
wait 3
expecttext skills.tooltip Hücum · Öğrenilmedi
expecttext skills.tooltip Çevrene
screenshot 03_tier2_open.png
clickon skills.plus.yarma
waitfor world+learned3+learnidle 300
clickon skills.plus.yarma
waitfor world+learned4+learnidle 300
expect world+unlocked0_3
clickon skills.plus.kan_ofkesi
waitfor world+learned5+learnidle 300
clickon skills.plus.kalkan_duvari
waitfor world+learned6+learnidle 300
clickon skills.plus.kalkan_duvari
waitfor world+learned7+learnidle 300
expect world+unlocked1_2+locked1_3
clickon skills.plus.meydan_okuma
waitfor world+learned8+learnidle 300
clickon skills.plus.sarsinti
waitfor world+learned9+learnidle 300
expect world+skillpoints0+noraise
scene expectskillpoints 0
scene expectrank yarma 2
scene expectrank kan_ofkesi 1
scene expectrank sarsinti 1
scene expectrank kalkan_duvari 2
scene expectrank meydan_okuma 1
expecttext skills.spent.0 Bu yolda harcanan: 6
expecttext skills.spent.1 Bu yolda harcanan: 3
expecttext skills.rank.yarma 2/3
expecttext skills.points Yetenek puanı: 0
# ---- Onto the bar ----
dragon skills.cell.yarma skills.bar.2 16
waitfor world+barsets1+baridle 120
dragon skills.cell.kan_ofkesi skills.bar.3 16
waitfor world+barsets2+baridle 120
dragon skills.cell.meydan_okuma skills.bar.4 16
waitfor world+barsets3+baridle 120
dragon skills.cell.kalkan_duvari skills.bar.5 16
waitfor world+barsets4+baridle 120
dragon skills.cell.sarsinti skills.bar.6 16
waitfor world+barsets5+baridle 120
scene expectslot 2 yarma
scene expectslot 6 sarsinti
scene expectslot 3 kan_ofkesi
scene expectslot 4 meydan_okuma
scene expectslot 5 kalkan_duvari
hoveron skills.cell.meydan_okuma
wait 3
expecttext skills.tooltip Siper · Kademe 1/3
expecttext skills.tooltip Sonraki kademe:
screenshot 04_tree_spent.png
key k
waitfor world+skillsclosed 30
# ---- A buff: the icon under the panel, its tooltip, the aura ----
key 3
waitfor world+selfeffect_attack_up 120
scene expecteffect self attack_up kan_ofkesi
scene expecteffecttip self attack_up Saldırı +%15
scene expectart buff_aura_red 1
wait 3
hoveron effects.self.0
wait 3
expecttext effects.tooltip Kan Öfkesi
expecttext effects.tooltip Saldırı +%15
scene camera front 18 5
wait 4
screenshot 05_buff_icon_aura.png
waitfor world+ready_kalkan_duvari 120
key 5
waitfor world+selfeffect_defense_up 120
scene expectart shield_bubble_gold 1
scene expectart buff_aura_steel 1
scene expecteffect self defense_up kalkan_duvari
# ---- Two monsters at once: pull, taunt, Yarma ----
move 1100 420
scene camera behind 30 9
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 10
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
expect world+outsidesafe
scene pullpack Kül Çömezi 2
waitfor world+pulled 3600
waitfor world+closemonsters2 900
key 4
waitfor world+skilluses3 120
scene target nearest Kül Çömezi
waitfor world+targeteffect_taunt 60
wait 3
scene expecteffect target taunt meydan_okuma
scene expecteffecttip target taunt Kışkırtıldı
waitfor world+ready_sarsinti 120
key 6
waitfor world+skilluses4 120
waitfor world+targeteffect_stun 60
wait 3
scene expecteffect target stun sarsinti
scene expecteffecttip target stun Sersemledi
scene expectart stun_marker 1
scene camera side 24 6
wait 2
screenshot 06_stun_taunt.png
waitfor world+closemonsters2+ready_yarma 300
key 2
waitfor world+skilluses5 120
waitfor world+usehits2 60
scene expectart ground_ring_neutral 1
scene camera side 32 8
wait 2
screenshot 07_aoe_yarma.png
scene skilllog
scene combatlog
quit
